WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:02.877
There were once two sisters.

00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:06.256
The older sister walked ahead of the younger one.

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:09.801
So the younger one always knew where to go.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:12.595
How are you doing?

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:15.432
Cause your Gram and I have been a little worried about you.

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:17.100
My sister is dead.

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.269
There’s no more music in me.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.896
No more dreams in me.

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:25.942
I’ve lost the one person on earth who understood me.

00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:28.111
How’s school?

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:29.362
Bad as expected?

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:31.906
There’s a new boy in honor band.

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:36.661
(Music playing)

00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:37.745
Hey!

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:39.914
You must be Lennie Walker.

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:44.711
Toby stopped by.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.504
Go keep him company, make him feel welcome.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.257
He is not interested in talking to me.

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:51.843
She was the love of his life.

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:54.679
No one at school gets it.

00:00:55.972 --> 00:00:57.348
I don’t think it’s possible to get it

00:00:57.849 --> 00:00:58.808
unless you’re in it.

00:00:58.808 --> 00:00:59.601
Like we are.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:02.228
Do you believe in signs?

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:03.730
The beyond?

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:05.231
I believe in everything.

00:01:06.983 --> 00:01:08.443
Yes, by the way.

00:01:09.277 --> 00:01:10.195
The heart breaks.

00:01:11.196 --> 00:01:12.739
Music escapes.

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:14.407
That’s how it gets out.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:21.456
(Music playing)

00:01:21.623 --> 00:01:22.791
Joe Fontaine.

00:01:23.124 --> 00:01:24.209
Toby Shaw.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:26.503
I know I shouldn’t have come.

00:01:26.503 --> 00:01:27.796
I just miss her so much.

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:30.965
We’re here

00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:32.342
and without her.

00:01:34.302 --> 00:01:35.136
Toby I can’t.

00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:37.597
Hey. You’re okay. You’re okay. You’re okay.

00:01:38.139 --> 00:01:41.142
And we’re gonna be okay.

00:01:41.142 --> 00:01:47.273
(Music Playing)

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.399
What’s going on with you two?

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:53.613
Grief and love I don’t think we get one without the other.

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:58.409
With Joe I feel so very alive.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:03.206
But when I’m with Toby there is someone with me in my grief.

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:06.376
I want to live like my sister did.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:10.380
With daring, and spirit,

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:13.716
(Music playing)

00:02:13.716 --> 00:02:16.010
and so much joy.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:25.019
(Music playing)

